# Stable spec ID: iba-brandy-crusta. Source checked 2026-10-13. Machine generated; not human reviewed or taste-tested.

::ingredients
(brandy) 52.5 ml
(maraschino liqueur @ Luxardo) 7.5 ml
(orange liqueur; curaçao) 1 barspoon
(lemon: juice, fresh) 15 ml
(simple syrup) 1 barspoon
(bitters; aromatic) 2 dashes

::equipment
(mixing glass)
(cocktail glass, slim)

::instructions
<coat, the rim of (cocktail glass, slim) with orange or lemon then powdered white sugar>
<place, curled orange or lemon peel inside the glass>
<stir, measured liquid ingredients with ice in (mixing glass)>
<strain, into the prepared glass>

